# 25. 🎯 Day 8 Core Concept

Remember these points:

```text
Loop
  ↓
Repetition
```

```text
while
→ Check first → Execute
```

```text
do-while
→ Execute first → Check
```

```text
for
→ Initialization → Condition → Body → Update
```

```text
for-each
→ Directly iterate values
```

```text
break
→ STOP
```

```text
continue
→ SKIP
```

```text
nested loop
→ Loop inside another loop
```

